2026-06-19 15:57:18,186 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To address the tender's requirements, we can implement the following security controls and compliance measures based on our company context. 

Firstly, for EU-only hosting and no data transfer outside EU, our hosting partner is OuraneCloud, which is a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensuring that all data is hosted within the European Union.

For encryption of sensitive data, we already have in place encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, which can be applied to protect sensitive health data. Additionally, our key management is based on EU-based infrastructure, further ensuring compliance with GDPR requirements.

Regarding explainability of AI recommendations, our product Atelier provides grounded-in-sources explanations, retrieval trace, audit log, and supports a posteriori review, thereby enabling the explainability of AI-driven recommendations post-hoc.

