Lastly, our system supports pseudonymisation, data minimization, and configurable retention, which are essential for protecting sensitive health information and adhering to the principles of GDPR. 

By implementing these measures, we can satisfy the tender's requirements related to GDPR compliance, explainability of AI recommendations, and medical confidentiality, while also ensuring that our solution aligns with French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification standards.
